# UI/UX Screen Specification V3

## Purpose
Ensure responsive, intuitive, and visually stunning mobile interfaces with automatic text wrapping and robust accessibility standards.

## Scope
- All Flutter screens, navigation flows, popups, and micro-interaction animations.

## SSOT
- `HEALTH IS ALL/04_FRONTEND/UI_SCREEN_SPECIFICATION.mdux`

## Definitions
- **Responsive Fluidity:** Layout adaptation across various mobile screen dimensions without text truncation.

## Runtime
- Flutter rendering engine on mobile client devices.

## Rules
1. Auto-line wrapping must be enabled on all text components to prevent clipping.
2. Primary action buttons (copy, download, confirm) must be clearly marked and easily accessible on mobile viewports.

## State
- `UIViewState`: LOADING | LOADED | ERROR | EMPTY

## Event
- `Event:ScreenOrientationChanged`: Triggers layout recalculation.

## Example
- Rendering a complex nutrition analytics graph with clean tooltips and zero text overflow.

## Exception
- Extreme screen aspect ratios fall back to scrollable single-column container layouts.

## Related Documents
- `HEALTH IS ALL/04_FRONTEND/UI_SCREEN_SPECIFICATION_V2.mdux`
- `HEALTH IS ALL/lib/app_theme.dart`

